<!-- wp:wdl/lw-pr-custom-title-15 {"mainTitle":"使える補助金","subTitle":"SUBSIDY","headingLevel":2} -->
<h2 class="wp-block-wdl-lw-pr-custom-title-15 lw-pr-custom-title-15" style="--custom-title-sub-margin-top-pc:0.2em;--custom-title-sub-margin-top-sp:0.2em;--title-15-after-color:var(--color-main);--title-15-after-mt-pc:1em;--title-15-after-mt-sp:0.8em;--title-15-after-h-pc:4px;--title-15-after-h-sp:4px;--title-15-after-w-pc:50px;--title-15-after-w-sp:50px;--title-15-font-size_pc:16px;--title-15-font-size_sp:16px"><span class="main">使える補助金</span><span class="sub">SUBSIDY</span></h2>
<!-- /wp:wdl/lw-pr-custom-title-15 -->
<!-- wp:paragraph {"align":"center"} -->
<p class="has-text-align-center">断熱・耐震・水まわりの一部は、<span class="lw-br on_500px"></span>国や自治体の<span class="lw-br on_500px"></span>補助金が使えます。<br>申請はこちらで代行しますので、<span class="lw-br on_500px"></span>お客様に書いていただく<span class="lw-br on_500px"></span>書類はありません。</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->
<!-- wp:wdl/lw-space-1 {"pcHeight":40,"tbHeight":32,"spHeight":24} -->
<div class="wp-block-wdl-lw-space-1 lw_space_1"><div class="pc" style="height:40px"></div><div class="tb" style="height:32px"></div><div class="sp" style="height:24px"></div></div>
<!-- /wp:wdl/lw-space-1 -->
